OL,3,GNEWSADown's syndrome project promotes
OL,4,Ablack visibility
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "We have created this sense
OL,7,Fof community amongst those of African
OL,8,Fheritage where they can meet
OL,9,Flike-minded families."
OL,11,FShe added that it was "incredible" that
OL,12,Fthe initiative had been nominated by a
OL,13,Fparent for a BBC Make a Difference
OL,14,FAward for Best Community Project.
